 "title": "Central Ohio Farmers Co-op - Homepage",
 "text": "-->\nCentral Ohio Farmers Co-op - Homepage\n-->\nHomepage\nToggle Navigation\nHOURS\nGRAIN BIDS\nMY ACCOUNTS\nCAREERS\nGROWER PORTAL\nABOUT US\nBOARD OF DIRECTORS\nOUR HISTORY\nCONTACT US\nRESOURCES\nCOMPETITOR BIDS\nMY ACCOUNT\nMEMBERS\nDOCUMENTS\nCAREERS\nSDS FORMS\nLOCATIONS\nFREDERICKTOWN\nFUEL DEPOT\nGREEN CAMP\nKENTON\nLIMA\nMARION GRAIN\nMARION OIL\nMONNETT\nMT. GILEAD\nMT. VERNON\nMT. VERNON FUEL\nNEW BLOOMINGTON\nOIL & LUBES\nPROSPECT\nTIFFIN\nWALDO\nDIVISIONS\nAGRONOMY\nSEED\nFEED & FARM SUPPLY\nFUEL\nGRAIN\nOILS AND LUBES\nPROPANE\nHOME\n-->\nPrevious\nNext\n-->\n-->\nTHANK YOU! A big thank you to everyone who joined us in Green Camp for our Propane Customer Appreciation event. We truly appreciate your continued support and the opportunity to serve you.\nDon't Forget About Our Summer Fill Program! Our Summer Fill Program is now underway and is available to all Central Ohio Farmers' Cooperative propane customers. It's the perfect time to top off your propane tank and take advantage of our seasonal pricing.\n- Available for customer-owned propane tanks.\n- Will Call customers: Please take a moment to check your tank level and give us a call if you'd like to participate.\n- To qualify for the Summer Fill price, propane tanks must be at 60% or less.\nIf you have any questions or would like to schedule your fill, we're happy to help. Thank you for choosing Central Ohio Farmers' Cooperative. We value your business and look forward to serving you all year long.\nPropane is for Everyone.\nCOFC’s corporate grain department is located at our Prospect location. The grain department’s direct phone number is 740-382-8132. If you want to talk to someone in person, please visit our Prospect office at 1007 E. Water Street. For payments, you have the options of having your funds ACH’ed or mailed to you, or you can stop by Prospect.\nClick this link to access your online account!\n|\n-->\n-->\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n-->\n-->\n-->\n-->\nHOURS OF OPERATION\n-->\n-->\nGRAIN BIDS\n-->\n-->\nMY ACCOUNT\n-->\n-->\nCAREERS\n-->\nMonnett Corn Bids\nCash Price\n| Futures Change\n| Delivery Start\n| Delivery End\n|\nNo data available in table |\nView all cash prices...\nQuotes are delayed, as of October 17, 2026, 09:38:19 PM CDT or prior.\nAll grain prices are subject to change at any time.\nCash bids are based on 10-minute delayed futures prices, unless otherwise noted.\nMarion Bean Bids\nCash Price\n| Futures Change\n| Delivery Start\n| Delivery End\n|\nNo data available in table |\nView all cash prices...\nQuotes are delayed, as of October 17, 2026, 09:38:19 PM CDT or prior.\nAll grain prices are subject to change at any time.\nCash bids are based on 10-minute delayed futures prices, unless otherwise noted.\nLocal Weather\nCheck your local Weather\n-->\nForecast\nDetailed Weather\nDownload the Central Ohio Farmers Co-op App Today!\nMarket Snapshot\nName | Month | Open | High | Low | Last | Change |\nCorn | Dec 26 | 478-0 | 481-0 | 473-0 | 474-2s | -3-6 |\nCorn | Mar 27 | 491-0 | 493-0 | 485-2 | 486-4s | -4-4 |\nCorn | May 27 | 498-0 | 499-6 | 492-4 | 493-4s | -4-4 |\nCorn | Jul 27 | 503-2 | 504-6 | 497-6 | 499-2s | -4-2 |\n|\nSoybean | Nov 26 | 1263-0 | 1265-6 | 1253-2 | 1261-2s | -1-6 |\nSoybean | Jan 27 | 1278-2 | 1280-6 | 1268-4 | 1275-6s | -2-0 |\nSoybean | Mar 27 | 1286-4 | 1289-2 | 1277-6 | 1284-2s | -2-0 |\nSoybean | May 27 | 1295-4 | 1297-6 | 1286-4 | 1292-2s | -2-6 |\n|\nWheat | Dec 26 | 669-4 | 670-2 | 656-2 | 660-4s | -9-4 |\nWheat | Mar 27 | 684-4 | 684-4 | 671-0 | 675-0s | -9-2 |\n|\nFeeder Cattle | Oct 26 | 343.800 | 345.125 | 343.100 | 343.625s | +0.250 |\nFeeder Cattle | Nov 26 | 342.500 | 343.525 | 341.375 | 341.900s | -0.050 |\n|\nLive Cattle | Oct 26 | 226.000 | 227.800 | 226.000 | 227.550s | +1.600 |\nLive Cattle | Dec 26 | 227.200 | 228.750 | 227.075 | 228.350s | +1.100 |\n|\nLean Hogs | Dec 26 | 66.450 | 67.375 | 66.300 | 66.925s | +0.350 |\nLean Hogs | Feb 27 | 68.325 | 69.625 | 68.250 | 69.225s | +0.775 |\nQuote